WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.280
City overview: 2,000 places grouped into clusters.

00:02.280 --> 00:03.900
Clustering off: all 2,000 individual pins appear.

00:03.900 --> 00:05.100
Zoom in: only pins in the viewport remain mounted.

00:05.100 --> 00:06.400
Zoom in again: fewer pins are visible.

00:06.400 --> 00:08.700
Pan east, then update labels without replacing marker IDs.

00:08.700 --> 00:10.500
Select Place 0 from the full picker; the map fits it into view.

00:10.500 --> 00:12.650
Zoom out from the selected place.

00:12.650 --> 00:14.330
Return to city view with all 2,000 pins.

00:14.330 --> 00:15.066
Restore clustering; the selected pin stays visible.
